<title>AUSTRIA: Vienna bourse says share trading has resumed.</title>
<headline>Vienna bourse says share trading has resumed.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Vienna bourse said on Monday share trading resumed at 1035 GMT (1135 a.m. after a 40-minute suspension due to technical problems with its newly installed EQOS electronic trading system.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
